---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Privacy Policy — UK Peptides"
  description="Privacy Policy for uk-peptides.eu. How we collect, use, and protect your personal data."
>
  <section style="background:var(--dark);padding:3rem 0 2.5rem;">
    <div class="container--narrow">
      <h1 style="color:#fff;font-size:2rem;">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);margin-top:0.5rem;">Last updated: 15 January 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" style="background:var(--bg);">
    <div class="container--narrow">
      <div class="prose">

        <p>This Privacy Policy describes how UK Peptides (uk-peptides.eu) collects, uses, and protects information in connection with our website and services.</p>

        <h2>1. Data We Collect</h2>
        <p>When you place an order, we collect:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Name and surname</li>
          <li>Email address</li>
          <li>Shipping address (street, postcode, city, country)</li>
          <li>Order details (product, quantity, price)</li>
        </ul>
        <p>We do not collect or store payment card details. All payment processing is handled by Peptide-Pay, an independent third-party processor. We receive only a transaction confirmation and your order metadata.</p>
        <p>We collect standard server access logs (IP address, user agent, pages visited) for security and performance purposes.</p>

        <h2>2. How We Use Your Data</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>To fulfil your order and arrange delivery</li>
          <li>To send order confirmation and shipping notifications to your email address</li>
          <li>To respond to enquiries you send us</li>
          <li>To comply with applicable legal obligations</li>
        </ul>
        <p>We do not use your data for marketing purposes without your explicit consent. We do not sell, rent, or share your personal data with third parties except as described in this policy.</p>

        <h2>3. Data Sharing</h2>
        <p>Your data is shared with:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Peptide-Pay</strong> — our payment processor. Receives email address, order amount, and metadata necessary to process payment and send confirmation. Peptide-Pay's own privacy policy governs their handling of your data.</li>
          <li><strong>Shipping provider</strong> — your name and delivery address are shared with the courier to fulfil your order.</li>
          <li><strong>Vercel</strong> — our hosting infrastructure provider. Processes requests and logs in accordance with their privacy policy.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>4. Data Retention</h2>
        <p>Order records are retained for a minimum of 5 years to comply with commercial and tax record-keeping obligations. Email addresses are retained until you request deletion or until retention is no longer necessary for the purposes described above.</p>

        <h2>5. Your Rights</h2>
        <p>You have the right to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Access the personal data we hold about you</li>
          <li>Request correction of inaccurate data</li>
          <li>Request deletion of your data (subject to legal retention obligations)</li>
          <li>Object to processing of your data</li>
          <li>Lodge a complaint with the Information Commissioner's Office (ICO) in the UK</li>
        </ul>
        <p>To exercise these rights, contact us at: <a href="mailto:contact@uk-peptides.eu">contact@uk-peptides.eu</a></p>

        <h2>6. Cookies</h2>
        <p>This site uses only functional cookies necessary for checkout and research gate confirmation. We do not use advertising cookies or cross-site tracking. No cookie consent banner is required for strictly necessary cookies.</p>

        <h2>7. Security</h2>
        <p>All data transmitted between your browser and this site is encrypted via TLS (HTTPS). We implement appropriate technical and organisational measures to protect your personal data against unauthorised access, alteration, or disclosure.</p>

        <h2>8. Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>We may update this policy from time to time. Material changes will be noted with a revised "Last updated" date at the top of this page.</p>

        <h2>9. Contact</h2>
        <p>For privacy-related queries: <a href="mailto:contact@uk-peptides.eu">contact@uk-peptides.eu</a></p>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
